There is now 2 versions of the History executable.  One is for German users
the other for English users. If you going to use the German version
(specially created for Ulrich Reinders) there is no need to rename the
executable. Simply delete the version you do not require. The same datafiles
are used for both versions.

This is the final version of History. Now upto V1.5

I will be releasing from time to time updated datafiles.

Is the BBS scene so ignorant of programmers efforts, or is it just apathy?,
that makes you not want to write a simple email in aknowledgment of
programmers efforts?

